'''Rock Candy''' is an {{Uncommon}} [[Power Stones|Power Stone]], which unlocks the {{PowerStoneLink|Sweet}} power for [[Accessories]], granting {{Stat|hp}}, {{Stat|def}}, and {{Stat|spd}}. It also provides {{Stat|spd|+5}} as its unique power bonus.

== Obtaining ==
'''Rock Candy''' can be obtained during the [[Spooky Festival]] as a {{Green|2.083%}} chance drop from [[Trick or Treat Chest]]s.

== Requirements ==
'''Rock Candy''' has a{{Skillname|Combat XV}} requirement and is only used as a [[Power Stones|Power Stone]] for [[Accessories]]. Combining 9 '''Rock Candy''' at [[Maxwell]] will unlock the '''Sweet''' power permanently. 

